  "hints": [
    "Two couriers grabbing the same order is a race. What makes 'is it free? then take it' safe?",
    "Browsing and tracking are read-heavy and repetitive: cache them. Order processing can happen in the background.",
    "LB (2) → API (20) with Redis locks (2); API → Redis (2) → MongoDB (3); API → SQS → processors (3) → MongoDB."
  ],
