  "explanation": [
    "Lock (or conditionally update) the order when assigning a courier, so exactly one assignment wins.",
    "Menus change rarely and tracking is polled constantly: a cache absorbs both.",
    "Place orders into a queue; processors confirm with the restaurant, charge payment and trigger assignment at their own pace."
  ]
